---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/base';
import { registerFaq } from '../data/faq';

const title = "报名信息｜猫二杯 · STRIVE \"2\" PURRFFECT";
const description = "猫二杯报名通道尚未开启。了解报名流程、需要准备的材料与获取开赛通知的方式。";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} path="/register/">
<main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <span class="ghost-word" aria-hidden="true">ENTRY</span>
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑">
          <a href={u('/')}>Home</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">Entry</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="eyebrow">Entry / 报名</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">报名通道<br>尚未开启。</h1>
        <p class="page-intro">我们正在确认最后的赛程与规则。报名开放后，这里会第一时间更新入口、选手群信息与完整规则书。现在可以先看看需要准备什么。</p>
        <dl class="page-meta">
          <div class="page-meta-item">
            <dt>Status / 状态</dt>
            <dd>筹备中</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="page-meta-item">
            <dt>Open / 开放时间</dt>
            <dd>待公布</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="page-meta-item">
            <dt>Method / 报名方式</dt>
            <dd>待公布</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="page-meta-item">
            <dt>Projects / 项目</dt>
            <dd>Phigros / Phira</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="entry-status reveal">
          <div class="entry-status-top">
            <p class="eyebrow">Entry Status / 报名状态</p>
            <span class="tag tag--live">待开启</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="entry-status-title">报名通道尚未开启</h2>
          <p class="entry-status-en">ENTRY OPENS SOON</p>
          <p class="entry-status-copy">报名表、选手群与完整规则书正在准备中。开放后，这里会变成真正的报名入口。在那之前，建议先熟悉赛程与规则，别等到截止前才开始练曲。</p>
          <div class="entry-status-foot">
            <p>Last updated / 2026.11 · 报名信息将持续更新</p>
            <div class="end-cta-actions">
              <a class="btn btn--primary" href={u('/event/')}>查看赛事介绍 <span class="btn-arrow">↗</span></a>
              <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={u('/rules/')}>阅读规则 <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--line" id="steps">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <p class="section-label">01 / Steps</p>
          <div class="section-head-right">
            <h2 class="section-title">报名流程</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">报名开放后，整个流程会在这个页面更新。以下为拟定步骤，具体入口与时间待公布。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry-steps">
          <article class="entry-step reveal">
            <p class="entry-step-no">STEP 01</p>
            <h3>填写报名表</h3>
            <p>提交游戏 ID、联系方式、设备信息与参赛项目。请确保信息真实、可用。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="entry-step reveal" style="--delay: .05s">
            <p class="entry-step-no">STEP 02</p>
            <h3>加入选手群</h3>
            <p>获取赛程、曲池、提交入口与裁判通知。群号与入群方式将在报名页公布。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="entry-step reveal" style="--delay: .1s">
            <p class="entry-step-no">STEP 03</p>
            <h3>提交成绩</h3>
            <p>在截止时间前，按要求上传完整成绩录屏。逾期或材料不完整可能影响成绩认定。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="entry-step reveal" style="--delay: .15s">
            <p class="entry-step-no">STEP 04</p>
            <h3>等待赛程</h3>
            <p>裁判核对成绩并公布晋级名单。进入决赛后，按赛程参加直播对抗。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--alt section--line" id="checklist">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <p class="section-label">02 / Checklist</p>
          <div class="section-head-right">
            <h2 class="section-title">报名前，先准备好这些。</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">不需要现在就填，但可以先把材料备齐。报名开放时，你会感谢现在的自己。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="checklist reveal">
          <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>游戏 ID 与昵称（需与参赛账号一致）</span></li>
          <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>可用的 QQ 或邮箱，用于接收赛程通知</span></li>
          <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>设备型号与系统版本（手机 / 平板 / 电脑）</span></li>
          <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>可用的录屏方案，建议提前测试画质与存储空间</span></li>
          <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>比赛期间可参赛的时间段</span></li>
          <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>未成年人需取得监护人同意</span></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="notice reveal" style="margin-top: 30px;">
          <span class="notice-mark">TIP</span>
          <p><strong>先别急着买设备。</strong>比赛不限制设备价格，也不鼓励为了比赛临时换机。稳定、熟悉、能完整录屏，比参数更重要。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--line" id="entry-faq">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <p class="section-label">03 / FAQ</p>
          <div class="section-head-right">
            <h2 class="section-title">报名常见问题</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">更多问题请看完整 FAQ；组委会联系方式将在报名开启后公布。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-group reveal">
          {registerFaq.map((item) => (
            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary>{item.q}<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                {item.body.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}
              </div>
            </details>
          ))}
        </div>

        <p class="reveal" style="margin-top: 28px;"><a class="arrow-link" href={u('/faq/')}>查看完整 FAQ <span>↗</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--alt section--line" id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <p class="section-label">04 / Contact</p>
          <div class="section-head-right">
            <h2 class="section-title">获取开赛通知</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">报名开放、曲池公布与规则更新都会通过这些渠道发布。QQ 群与 Bilibili 账号将在确认后公布。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-grid">
          <a class="contact-card reveal" href={u('/')}>
            <p class="contact-label">Channel 01</p>
            <h3>本站公告</h3>
            <p>赛事日期、曲池与规则更新会第一时间发布在首页与赛程页。</p>
            <span class="arrow-link">返回首页 <span>↗</span></span>
          </a>
          <div class="contact-card contact-card--muted reveal" style="--delay: .05s">
            <p class="contact-label">Channel 02</p>
            <h3>组委会联系</h3>
            <p>联系邮箱与其他沟通渠道正在确认，将在报名开启时公布。</p>
            <span class="tag" style="margin-top: 20px;">待公布</span>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-card contact-card--muted reveal" style="--delay: .1s">
            <p class="contact-label">Channel 03</p>
            <h3>QQ 群 / Bilibili</h3>
            <p>选手群与官方账号正在准备中，群号与主页链接待公布。</p>
            <span class="tag" style="margin-top: 20px;">待公布</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tight section--line">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="end-cta reveal">
          <div class="end-cta-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">Before You Go / 离开之前</p>
            <h2 class="section-title">先把规则看一遍。</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">报名开放前，规则与赛程还会更新。提前了解流程，能少走很多弯路。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="end-cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href={u('/rules/')}>比赛规则 <span class="btn-arrow">↗</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={u('/schedule/')}>赛程与奖项 <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
